## After scope is set

- Read/edit only the scoped tree plus **confirmed** workspace dependencies (from that package’s `package.json` / `@chiwire/*` deps). Prefer `npm run dependency-map` only when dep edges are unclear — do not dump the whole graph into context.
- Root files (`package.json`, `AGENTS.md`, `scripts/`) only when required for the scoped task.
- Prefer workspace-scoped commands (`npm run build --workspace @chiwire/<name>`) over repo-wide `typecheck` / `build` unless asked or `FORCED_RUN: TRUE`.
- Do not open unrelated apps “just in case.”

## Examples

```text
PROJECT: contimiti
Fix the purge job TTL.
```

```text
FORCED_RUN: TRUE
Update deploy scripts used by every app.
```
